[32m+[m[32m# Proactive Guard — SIH 2026 Submission[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Project Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Proactive Guard** is an AI-powered personal safety platform that shifts the paradigm from *reactive* SOS buttons to *proactive* threat detection. By continuously monitoring audio, motion, and GPS sensors on a user's smartphone, our system detects danger **before the victim can press a button** — automatically alerting police, family, and security with live location, AI-generated incident summary, and sensor evidence.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### The Problem[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Every 16 minutes**, a woman reports a crime in India (NCRB 2022)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **73% of assault victims** cannot operate their phone during an attack (ICRW)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Existing solutions: Manual SOS only, no context, single recipient, no evidence[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Our Solution[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mMobile Sensors (Flutter) → FastAPI Backend → AI Risk Engine (Rules + Gemini) → Supabase → Next.js Command Center[m
[32m+[m[32m                                                              ↓[m
[32m+[m[32m                                              Auto-alerts: Police + Family + Security[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Key Innovation[m
[32m+[m[32m| Traditional Apps | Proactive Guard |[m
[32m+[m[32m|------------------|-----------------|[m
[32m+[m[32m| Wait for button press | Monitors sensors 24/7 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| User triggers alert | AI detects anomaly automatically |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Single recipient | Multi-channel simultaneous escalation |[m
[32m+[m[32m| No context | Audio + Motion + GPS + Time evidence |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Post-incident report | Live command center for authorities |[m
[32m+[m
